msgid "Handle"
msgstr "Handle"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:73
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Choose one of the built-in handles, *No Handle*, or *Custom*."
msgstr "Scegli una delle maniglie incluse, *No Handle* o *Custom*."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:82
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Custom Handle"
msgstr "Custom Handle"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:79
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Use your own handle. Choose *Custom* and assign your objects to *Lever Geometry* and *Backplate Geometry*. Refer to :ref:`customization` on how to prepare them."
msgstr "Usa la tua maniglia. Scegli *Custom* e assegna i tuoi oggetti a *Lever Geometry* e *Backplate Geometry*. Per prepararli vedi :ref:`customization`."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:88
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Lever Geometry"
msgstr "Lever Geometry"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:85
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "The part that you hold and turn to open or close the window."
msgstr "La parte che si impugna e si ruota per aprire o chiudere la finestra."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:94
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Backplate Geometry"
msgstr "Backplate Geometry"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:91
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Fixed decorative plate around the base of the handle."
msgstr "Placca decorativa fissa alla base della maniglia."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:100
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:554
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Handle Position"
msgstr "Handle Position"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:97
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Choose between *Centered* (the middle of the sash) and *Manual*."
msgstr "Scegli tra *Centered* (centro dell'anta) e *Manual*."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:106
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:560
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Manual Position"
msgstr "Manual Position"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:103
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:557
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Shown when *Handle Position* is set to *Manual*. Sets the height of the handle."
msgstr "Visibile quando *Handle Position* è impostato su *Manual*. Imposta l'altezza della maniglia."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:112
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:566
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Handle Rotation"
msgstr "Handle Rotation"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:109
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Sets the rotation of the handle."
msgstr "Imposta la rotazione della maniglia."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:115
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Glazing Settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni della vetratura"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:121
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:651
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:656
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Glazing"
msgstr "Glazing"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:118
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Choose between double glazing (two panes, one spacer) and triple glazing (three panes, two spacers). The animation shows the glazing from above."
msgstr "Scegli tra vetrocamera doppio (due lastre, un distanziatore) e triplo (tre lastre, due distanziatori). L'animazione mostra la vetratura vista dall'alto."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:124
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Lites Settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni delle inglesine"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:126
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Lites divide the glass into smaller panes. The panel is available for casement windows."
msgstr "Le inglesine dividono il vetro in riquadri più piccoli. Il pannello è disponibile per le finestre a battente."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:132
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Horizontal Lites"
msgstr "Horizontal Lites"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:129
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Sets the number of horizontal lites."
msgstr "Imposta il numero di inglesine orizzontali."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:138
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Vertical Lites"
msgstr "Vertical Lites"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:135
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Sets the number of vertical lites."
msgstr "Imposta il numero di inglesine verticali."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:144
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Lites Width"
msgstr "Lites Width"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:141
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Sets the width of the lites."
msgstr "Imposta la larghezza delle inglesine."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:147
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Materials"
msgstr "Materials"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:149
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Assign materials to the parts of the window and control the UV scale."
msgstr "Assegna i materiali alle parti della finestra e controlla la scala UV."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:154
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Each slot accepts any material in the file. Casement windows have *Hinge* and *Hardware* slots; portals and sliding windows have a *Rail Metal* slot instead."
msgstr "Ogni slot accetta qualsiasi materiale del file. Le finestre a battente hanno gli slot *Hinge* e *Hardware*; i portali e le finestre scorrevoli hanno invece uno slot *Rail Metal*."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:160
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Texel Density"
msgstr "Texel Density"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:157
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Sets the texel density (px/m) for the window. It works together with *Texture Resolution*."
msgstr "Imposta la densità di texel (px/m) della finestra. Funziona insieme a *Texture Resolution*."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:166
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Texture Resolution"
msgstr "Texture Resolution"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:163
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Sets the resolution of the texture. Change it to the resolution of the textures your material uses."
msgstr "Imposta la risoluzione della texture. Impostala sulla risoluzione delle texture usate dal tuo materiale."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:169
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Texel density controls how many texture pixels (texels) cover a meter of geometry. Use this formula:"
msgstr "La densità di texel indica quanti pixel di texture (texel) coprono un metro di geometria. Usa questa formula:"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:175
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Example: a 2048 px texture applied to a 2 m width gives a texel density of 1024 px/m."
msgstr "Esempio: una texture da 2048 px applicata su 2 m di larghezza dà una densità di 1024 px/m."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:177
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Some texture resources (Megascans, Poliigon, Greyscale Gorilla etc.) include physical size of the texture in meters:"
msgstr "Alcune risorse di texture (Megascans, Poliigon, Greyscale Gorilla, ecc.) indicano la dimensione fisica della texture in metri:"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:183
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "For the materials to work correctly for mapping, choose the **UV Map** node and select UVMap (in some cases, the **Realize Instances** option must be enabled in the Options section)."
msgstr "Perché la mappatura dei materiali funzioni correttamente, usa il nodo **UV Map** e scegli UVMap (in alcuni casi va attivata l'opzione **Realize Instances** nella sezione Options)."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:190
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "**UVMaps:** The window includes necessary UVMaps, although there may be rotation issues at certain widths due to limitations in controlling UV unwrapping in geometry nodes."
msgstr "**Mappe UV:** la finestra include le mappe UV necessarie, anche se con certe larghezze possono esserci problemi di rotazione dovuti ai limiti nel controllo dello svolgimento UV nei geometry nodes."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:191
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "**Spacer Material:** If you wish to change the spacer material, it's recommended to adjust the existing material to your needs as it contains a custom bump map for a realistic look and helps to reduce extra geometry for the spacer."
msgstr "**Materiale del distanziatore:** se vuoi cambiare il materiale del distanziatore, conviene adattare il materiale esistente: contiene una bump map dedicata per un aspetto realistico ed evita geometria aggiuntiva."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:194
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Options"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:200
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Origin in Center"
msgstr "Origin in Center"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:197
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Moves the origin from the bottom of the window to the center of its bounding box."
msgstr "Sposta l'origine dalla base della finestra al centro del suo bounding box."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:206
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Realize Instances"
msgstr "Realize Instances"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:203
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Converts instances into real geometry. Keep it off while you work: the viewport is faster and the file smaller. Turn it on when a material or another modifier needs real geometry. The animation shows the vertex count in the viewport statistics."
msgstr "Converte le istanze in geometria reale. Tienilo disattivato mentre lavori: il viewport è più veloce e il file più leggero. Attivalo quando un materiale o un altro modificatore ha bisogno di geometria reale. L'animazione mostra il numero di vertici nelle statistiche del viewport."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:215
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Apply Modifier"
msgstr "Apply Modifier"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:209
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Turns the window into a plain mesh."
msgstr "Trasforma la finestra in una semplice mesh."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:215
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Once applied, the window is no longer parametric and the settings panel disappears. Use it when you need to edit the final geometry by hand. To hand a window over to another program, use the export described in :ref:`export` instead; it leaves the original window untouched."
msgstr "Dopo l'applicazione la finestra non è più parametrica e il pannello delle impostazioni scompare. Usalo quando devi modificare a mano la geometria finale. Per passare una finestra a un altro programma, usa invece l'esportazione descritta in :ref:`export`: lascia intatta la finestra originale."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:218
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Window Single"
msgstr "Window Single"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:219
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "A window featuring a single operable sash that can either tilt or turn."
msgstr "Una finestra con una sola anta apribile a ribalta o a battente."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:228
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Sets the direction in which the sash opens."
msgstr "Imposta il verso di apertura dell'anta."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:237
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Swing Side"
msgstr "Swing Side"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:234
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Sets the side the sash is hinged on."
msgstr "Imposta il lato delle cerniere dell'anta."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:243
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:293
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Turn Angle"
msgstr "Turn Angle"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:240
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:290
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Sets the turn angle of the sash."
msgstr "Imposta l'angolo di apertura a battente dell'anta."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:249
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:299
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:440
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:456
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Tilt Angle"
msgstr "Tilt Angle"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:246
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:296
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:437
#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:453
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Sets the tilt angle of the sash."
msgstr "Imposta l'angolo di apertura a ribalta dell'anta."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:252
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Window Single Frame"
msgstr "Window Single Frame"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:253
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "A window with a fixed, non-opening section. It has no *Rotation* and no *Handle* panel."
msgstr "Una finestra con una parte fissa che non si apre. Non ha i pannelli *Rotation* e *Handle*."

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:259
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "Window Mullion 1 Sash"
msgstr "Window Mullion 1 Sash"

#: (2)/Documentation/windowgen-documentation-4.0/docs/source/parameters.rst:260
#: DESKTOP-HETTM96/WindowGen
msgid "A window featuring a single operable sash alongside a fixed, non-opening section."
msgstr "Una finestra con un'anta apribile accanto a una parte fissa che non si apre."

